<sect2 id="gimp-view-show-guides">
  <title>Exibir as guias</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Guias</primary>
    <secondary>Exibir/esconder as guias</secondary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Exibir as guias</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <para>O comando <guimenuitem>Exibir as guias</guimenuitem> ativa e desativa a exibição das <link linkend="glossary-guides">Guias</link> no menu da janela de imagem.</para>
  <para>
    You can set the default for the guides in the
    <link linkend="gimp-prefs-image-window-appearance">Image Window Appearance Preferences</link>.
  </para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o comando</title>
    <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          You can access this command from the main menu through
          <menuchoice>
            <guimenu>View</guimenu>
            <guimenuitem>Show Guides</guimenuitem>
          </menuchoice>.
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          You can also use the keyboard shortcut
          <keycombo>
            <keycap>Shift</keycap>
            <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>
            <keycap>T</keycap>
          </keycombo>.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
